# Real student schedules never belong in this repository.
# Everything in students/ is a real person's schedule except these two.
students/*
!students/example.py
!students/README.md

# Build products. Regenerate with build.py, calendars.py and assemble.py —
# site/index.html and src/district_data.json are the exceptions: they are
# generated but committed, because Pages serves them as they are found.
*.xlsx
*.ics
*.pdf
workbooks/blocks.pkl

